\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The proving pipeline. The emulator cuts the run into $N$ shards of a few million cycles and emits one record per shard; each record is proved independently as one Jagged-\ensuremath  {\mathsf  {WHIR}}{} shard proof $\pi _i$; leaf programs (L) verify one or two shard proofs each and a range tree of compose programs (C, arity at most four) merges them; the root of the tree is the \emph  {compressed proof}, the object measured throughout this paper.}}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{4}{The proving pipeline. The emulator cuts the run into $N$ shards of a few million cycles and emits one record per shard; each record is proved independently as one Jagged-\WHIR {} shard proof $\pi _i$; leaf programs (L) verify one or two shard proofs each and a range tree of compose programs (C, arity at most four) merges them; the root of the tree is the \emph {compressed proof}, the object measured throughout this paper}{figure.caption.4}{}}
